<</Author(Tom Klootwijk)/CreationDate(D:20000101000000+00'00')/Creator(JTK formalization, edition 1.0)/Keywords()/ModDate(D:20000101000000+00'00')/Producer(ReportLab PDF Library - (opensource))/Subject(Formal specification, dedicated to Jitske Koenders)/Title(JTK: A Deterministic Architecture of Reciprocal Feedback)/Trapped/False>>
